{"id":"vpryam_","lemma":"впрямь","pos":"adv","rank":2795,"glosses":["really, indeed"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ef/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BF%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%BC%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BF%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%BC%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мне и впрямь нравится снег.","en":"I really like snow.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"},{"g":"snow"}]},{"text":"Это и впрямь так существенно?","en":"Is it really such a big deal?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"so"},{"g":"considerably"}]},{"text":"Ты однако и впрямь часто так делаешь.","en":"You sure do do that a lot.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"however, yet, still"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"frequently, often"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"}]},{"text":"У неё и впрямь уставший вид.","en":"She does look tired.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},null,{"g":"and"},null,null,{"g":"look"}]},{"text":"Иногда жизнь и впрямь подражает искусству.","en":"Sometimes life really does imitate art.","words":[{"g":"sometimes, at times"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"and"},null,null,null]}]}